   window.CBSView.open({u, n, list:[{u,n}], actions:[{label, onClick(file)}], noOffice})  /  CBSView.close()  /  CBSView.kind(file)
   PDFs (pdf.js), photos and videos show full screen with the page behind locked (no background scroll, position restored on close).
   Word / Excel / PowerPoint open straight in Office (new tab) unless noOffice (crew links: Download instead). Toolbar: name, previous /
   next through the list, the caller's extra actions, Download, Full screen, Close. Esc, the phone's back button and Close all close it. */
(function(){
